amma beam got me. What to watch for in the Iron Maw fight The gamma beam runs from the boss's hull through your cell and on to the rock, hitting everything on the line, enemies included. A step to the side or a wall between you is what saves you. The wave spreads out as a r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:22:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041197","verified_at":"2026-10-25T06:36:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5095060-1847286114035423","game_id":"steam-5095060","kind":"update","title":"Update: experimental \"On the beat\" mode, sniper and mortar fixes","summary":"This is an update to the full version. The Steam Next Fest demo stays as it is until the festival ends; the changes will reach it later.\"On the beat\" mode (experiment). Settings, right under Difficulty, now has a \"Step rhythm\" switch. \"Free\" is the game as before. \"On the beat\" means that in combat your step goes only on the beat, one cell per beat, together with the enemies. A click right after the beat steps at once; an early click waits for the beat and is shown as a green hologram on the des","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035423","verified_at":"2026-10-23T10:33:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5095060-1846651706691482","game_id":"steam-5095060","kind":"announcement","title":"AsterMaster is in Steam Next Fest — free demo, updated build","summary":"Steam Next Fest is live and the AsterMaster demo is in it — free, no key, 15–20 minute runs.What changed since the demo launched (thanks to everyone who sent feedback):• Callouts (TRIPLE KILL, RAMPAGE…) now use a dedicated display font and are larger; mod and power-up icons got backing plates so they read at 1080p.• Dash: double-click dash can now be turned off in Settings (mouse players kept triggering it by accident), and right-clicking a cell dashes there regardless of the setting.• Mines now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5095060-1846018067926098","game_id":"steam-5095060","kind":"announcement","title":"AsterMaster free demo is out now on Steam","summary":"The AsterMaster demo is free — hit “Download Demo” on the store page.It isn’t “five minutes and credits”. It’s the asteroid’s first segment looped downward: clear the arena, a descent platform opens, and the next horizon hits harder than the last.What’s inside:— the full combat loop: weapon mods, synergies, power-ups, depths, smugglers and a bounty on your head — same as the full game;— a three-way fork before the first arena, a different mod in each passage: pick one and you walk into the boss ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:18:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5095060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5095060":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5095060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z"},"5178780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5095060","app_id":5095060,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1edd72e2e805bf88a024a81060be25020ca2c535f9be3e1cb24e6f7a6b849e04","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A roguelite shooter on a hex grid where bosses are clouds of 6,000 shards: every hit carves a real crater, dig through the plating and chunks tear off. Enemies move on the beat, you play in real time. Stack weapon mods, chase synergies, haul your ore back out alive. Steam Deck friendly.","publishers":[{"name":"Zebka LTD"}],"developers":[{"name":"Zebka LTD"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"AsterMaster — Boss Destruction","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792469961","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5095060/32437007/3924fd4c388af88a1984d143392902714af31df0/1792468684/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5095060/32437007/3924fd4c388af88a1984d143392902714af31df0/1792468684/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"5095060/32437007/3924fd4c388af88a1984d143392902714af31df0/1792468684/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"5095060/32437007/3924fd4c388af88a1984d143392902714af31df0/1792468684/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"5095060/32437007/3924fd4c388af88a1984d143392902714af31df0/1792468684/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257470225/7c03a9fa71565598ad58dfa042e8d5ed9e4aaad5/movie_600x337.jpg","screensho